@startuml riot-api-extension
title RiotAPIClient — Protocol extendido en 003-edit-profile

skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
hide empty members

interface "RiotAPIClient" as RAC <<Protocol>> {
  +validate_riot_id(game_name, tag_line): bool                           ' heredado 002
  +get_match_by_tournament_code(code): MatchResult | None                ' heredado 002 (DEFER)
  ..métodos NUEVOS en 003..
  +resolve_puuid(game_name, tag_line, region): str                       ' usado solo dentro de profile_service.link_lol
  +get_summoner_profile(puuid): SummonerProfile
  +get_ranked_stats(puuid): RankedStats
  +get_champion_mastery(puuid, limit=5): list<ChampionMastery>
  +get_recent_matches(puuid, limit=5): list<MatchSummary>
}

class "MockRiotAPIClient" as MOCK {
  -configured_riot_ids: set<(game_name, tag_line)>
  -configured_match_results: dict<code, MatchResult>
  -configured_summoner: dict<puuid, SummonerProfile>
  -configured_ranked: dict<puuid, RankedStats>
  -configured_mastery: dict<puuid, list<ChampionMastery>>
  -configured_matches: dict<puuid, list<MatchSummary>>
  +(implementa todos los métodos del Protocol)
}

class "HttpRiotAPIClient" as HTTP {
  -api_key: str
  -client: httpx.AsyncClient
  -timeout_per_call: float = 2.0
  +(implementa todos los métodos del Protocol)
  ..acceso a Riot..
  -_regional_host(region): str
  -_platform_host(region): str
}

class "get_riot_api_client(settings)" as FACTORY <<factory>> {
  RIOT_API_KEY ausente -> MockRiotAPIClient (con log INFO)
  RIOT_API_KEY presente -> HttpRiotAPIClient (cableado en 003)
}

RAC <|.. MOCK
RAC <|.. HTTP
FACTORY ..> RAC : returns

note right of RAC
  Constitución IV: el Protocol es la única
  abstracción permitida en torno a Riot.
  No se introduce un wrapper extra.
end note

note bottom of MOCK
  Constitución II (TDD):
  todos los tests del perfil
  inyectan MOCK con datos sembrados.
end note

note bottom of HTTP
  Endpoints consumidos:
  - /riot/account/v1/accounts/by-riot-id/{name}/{tag}
  - /lol/summoner/v4/summoners/by-puuid/{puuid}
  - /lol/league/v4/entries/by-puuid/{puuid}
  - /lol/champion-mastery/v4/champion-masteries/by-puuid/{puuid}/top
  - /lol/match/v5/matches/by-puuid/{puuid}/ids
  - /lol/match/v5/matches/{matchId}
end note

note as SCOPE
  En 003 SOLO se usa get_match_by_tournament_code
  como herencia (sigue DEFER en 002).
  La verificación de partidas en torneos NO se cablea
  desde un endpoint en esta iteración.
end note

@enduml
